<!-- 
================================================================
AI Banking GRC Platform - Favicon Instructions
================================================================

This file is a placeholder for the favicon.ico file.
The actual favicon should be a multi-size icon file.

================================================================
HOW TO CREATE THE FAVICON
================================================================

1. Create a favicon using one of these methods:
   - Use an online favicon generator (realfavicongenerator.net)
   - Create a 256x256 PNG and convert to .ico
   - Use a design tool to create the icon

2. The icon should feature:
   - Primary Color: #0B3D91 (Dark Blue)
   - Secondary Color: #2563EB (Blue)
   - Symbol: GRC or Shield icon
   - Clean, professional banking design

3. Recommended sizes in .ico file:
   - 16x16
   - 32x32
   - 48x48
   - 64x64
   - 128x128
   - 256x256

================================================================
WHERE TO PLACE
================================================================

Place the favicon.ico file in the public/ directory:
/public/favicon.ico

The browser will automatically detect it, but it's also linked in:
- layouts/master.php: <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
- layouts/header.php: <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">

================================================================
ADDITIONAL ICON FILES
================================================================

For better browser support, also create these files in the 
public/ directory:

1. apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
   - Used by iOS devices
   - Place at: /apple-touch-icon.png

2. android-chrome-192x192.png
   - Used by Android devices
   - Place at: /android-chrome-192x192.png

3. android-chrome-512x512.png
   - Used by Android devices
   - Place at: /android-chrome-512x512.png

4. mstile-150x150.png
   - Used by Windows devices
   - Place at: /mstile-150x150.png

5. safari-pinned-tab.svg
   - Used by Safari browser
   - Place at: /safari-pinned-tab.svg

================================================================
HOW TO GENERATE ALL ICONS
================================================================

1. Go to https://realfavicongenerator.net/
2. Upload your design (recommended 260x260)
3. Download the generated package
4. Extract the files to your project root

The generator will create:
- favicon.ico
- android-chrome-*.png
- apple-touch-icon.png
- mstile-*.png
- safari-pinned-tab.svg
- browserconfig.xml
- site.webmanifest

================================================================
REFERENCE HTML FOR HEAD SECTION
================================================================

Include these in the <head> section of your layout:

<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
<link rel="mask-icon" href="/safari-pinned-tab.svg" color="#0B3D91">
<meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#0B3D91">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0B3D91">

================================================================
CREATING A SIMPLE FAVICON (Quick Method)
================================================================

If you need a quick favicon, create a 256x256 PNG with:

1. A dark blue background (#0B3D91)
2. White text "GRC" in bold
3. A shield icon or banking symbol
4. Save as favicon.png
5. Convert to .ico using: https://convertio.co/png-ico/

================================================================
DESIGN RECOMMENDATIONS
================================================================

The favicon should represent:
- Banking & Finance: Use shield, building, or bank symbol
- Technology: Clean, modern design
- Trust & Security: Professional and reliable appearance

Color Palette:
- Primary: #0B3D91 (Dark Blue)
- Secondary: #2563EB (Blue)
- Accent: #00B894 (Green)
- White: #FFFFFF
- Gold: #F59E0B

================================================================
PLACEHOLDER FILES
================================================================

If you haven't created the favicon yet, create a simple placeholder:

1. Create a 16x16 transparent PNG
2. Fill with dark blue (#0B3D91)
3. Add a white "G" or "GRC" text
4. Save as favicon.ico

This will serve as a temporary favicon until you design a professional one.

================================================================
SAMPLE ICO CREATION COMMAND (Linux/Mac)
================================================================

Using ImageMagick:
convert -size 256x256 xc:#0B3D91 -font Arial -pointsize 120 -fill white -gravity center -draw "text 0,0 'GRC'" favicon.png
convert favicon.png -define icon:auto-resize=16,32,48,64,128,256 favicon.ico

================================================================
-->

<!-- This is a comment placeholder for favicon.ico -->
<!-- The actual favicon.ico file should be placed in the public/ directory -->